(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: the plate is not moved back onto
   the magnet after the elution, and the eluates are taken off the magnet,
   which aspirates the beads. The box of the elution holds; the grade of the
   function does not: the transfer is excluded from the time after the move
   off the magnet:

     Typing error: This function's body has grade `{MagnetOff; EluteDNA; idle 5;
       Transfer}`, which does not match its annotated grade ...
*)
(*
